OL,3,CVictim of stabbing at asylum hotel is
OL,4,Ca support worker, local MP says
OL,6,FA support staff worker has been
OL,7,Fstabbed at a Surrey hotel used to
OL,8,Fhouse asylum seekers, a local MP has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FArmed officers from Surrey Police were
OL,12,Fcalled to the hotel, in Staines, at
OL,13,F6.30pm on Saturday to a report of a
OL,14,Fstabbing, the force said.
OL,16,FPolice said a man in his 30s had been
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital with "life-
OL,18,Fthreatening injuries".
