OL,3,CVictim of stabbing at asylum hotel is
OL,4,Ca support worker, local MP says
OL,6,FA Somali man, in his 20s, was arrested
OL,7,Fon suspicion of attempted murder and
OL,8,Fremains in police custody.
OL,10,FConservative MP Lincoln Jopp posted a
OL,11,Fvideo on Facebook on Sunday in which
OL,12,Fhe said the victim of the stabbing was
OL,13,Fa support staff worker.
