OL,3,CVictim of stabbing at asylum hotel is
OL,4,Ca support worker, local MP says
OL,6,FHe said he received a phone call on
OL,7,FSaturday from the chief constable of
OL,8,FSurrey Police informing him of the
OL,9,Fstabbing.
OL,11,FMr Jopp, MP for Spelthorne, said "one
OL,12,Fof the support staff who work here was
OL,13,Fstabbed", and that "one of the people
OL,14,Fwho live here was arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of attempted murder".
OL,17,FPolice previously said they were not
OL,18,Flooking for anyone else in relation to
OL,19,Fthe incident, and asked anyone with
OL,20,Finformation to get in touch.
