OL,3,CVictim of stabbing at asylum hotel is
OL,4,Ca support worker, local MP says
OL,6,FDetective Superintendent Kate Hyder
OL,7,Fsaid on Saturday: "We understand this
OL,8,Fincident has caused concern within the
OL,9,Flocal community, and I encourage you
OL,10,Fto speak to local officers."
